<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - People's Bank said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - People's Bank said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman raised its rating on Friday of Bridgeport, Connecticut-based People's Bank to an outperform from its previous rating of neutral, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 24-5/8 in early trading.</p>
</text>
